OL,3,GNEWSA'Hazardous' cracking paths a 'real
OL,4,Aconcern'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs are due to start on "hazardous"
OL,7,Fpaths which have become a "real
OL,8,Fconcern" for a community, councillors
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FPhotos show huge cracks running down
OL,12,FLavinia Walk in Priory Vale, Swindon
OL,13,Fwhich have been an issue for "three or
OL,14,Ffour years," said Swindon Borough
OL,15,Fcouncillor Vinay Manro, who represents
OL,16,FPriory Vale.
OL,18,F"The cracking around Lavinia Walk is
OL,19,Famong the worst we have seen locally
OL,20,Fand has continued to deteriorate," Cllr
OL,21,FLeanne Stevenson said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
